sequenceDiagram
    actor HOD as HOD
    participant R as TimetableRouter
    participant U as UploadTimetableUseCase
    participant S as MinIO storage
    participant W as Celery worker
    participant P as ParseTimetableUseCase
    participant C as ConfirmTimetableUseCase
    participant M as MaterialiseTimetableEventsUseCase
    HOD->>R: POST /api/timetables/upload (file, term)
    R->>U: execute(file, department, term)
    U->>S: store file under random key
    U-->>R: TimetableUpload [UPLOADED]
    R->>W: process_timetable_upload(upload_id)
    R-->>HOD: 202 Accepted
    W->>P: execute(upload_id)
    P->>P: factory picks parser, parse grid
    P->>P: resolve initials (exact, alias, fuzzy)
    P-->>W: preview and issue report [PREVIEW_READY]
    HOD->>R: GET /api/timetables/{id}
    R-->>HOD: preview slots, unresolved tokens
    HOD->>R: POST /api/timetables/{id}/confirm
    R->>C: execute(upload_id)
    C->>C: save courses, sections, rooms, slots [CONFIRMED]
    C-->>R: TimetableConfirmed event
    R-->>HOD: 200 OK
    W->>M: materialise term (21-day window)
    loop each slot and each non-holiday date
        M->>M: create CLASS event and attendee
        M->>M: plan reminders (idempotency key)
    end
